# Sprint board

Everything still open, as a query rather than a list somebody maintains.

```hql#eval
cards
| filter(c => c.metadata.status == "todo")
| sort(by = c => c.title)
| map(c => c.title)
```

## Closest to bearer tokens

```hql#query
import lexical

cards
| lexical("bearer token authorization")
| take(2)
| markdown
```
